### Color Usage Rules

#### Backgrounds
| Use Case | Color | Tailwind Class |
|----------|-------|----------------|
| Page background | White | `bg-white` |
| Subtle sections | Off-white with sage tint | `bg-background-subtle` or `bg-[#f8faf8]` |
| Muted sections | Light sage | `bg-background-muted` or `bg-repwell-sage-100/30` |
| Dark sections (CTAs, hero variants) | Deep teal | `bg-repwell-teal-500` |
| Cards | White with subtle border | `bg-white border border-border` |

#### Text
| Use Case | Color | Tailwind Class |
|----------|-------|----------------|
| Headings | Deep teal | `text-repwell-teal-500` |
| Body text | Deep teal (slightly lighter) | `text-repwell-teal-400` |
| Secondary/muted text | Mid teal | `text-repwell-teal-300` |
| Links | Primary teal | `text-primary hover:text-primary-hover` |
| Text on dark backgrounds | White or sage-100 | `text-white` or `text-repwell-sage-100` |

#### Interactive Elements
| Element | Default | Hover | Active |
|---------|---------|-------|--------|
| Primary button | `bg-repwell-teal-300` | `bg-repwell-teal-400` | `bg-repwell-teal-500` |
| Secondary button | `bg-transparent border-repwell-teal-300` | `bg-repwell-sage-100/50` | `bg-repwell-sage-100` |
| Ghost button | `bg-transparent` | `bg-repwell-sage-100/30` | `bg-repwell-sage-100/50` |
| Links | `text-repwell-teal-300` | `text-repwell-teal-400` | Underline |

