## Typography

### Font Stack

**Display/Headlines**: `"Erstoria", Georgia, serif` (Custom font)
- Use for: H1, H2, hero text, marketing headlines
- Conveys: Trust, establishment, editorial quality
- Loaded via @font-face in globals.css from /fonts/Erstoria.woff2

**Body/UI**: `"Source Sans 3", system-ui, sans-serif`
- Use for: Body text, UI elements, buttons, navigation, H3-H6
- Conveys: Clean, readable, modern, professional
- Loaded via next/font/google in layout.tsx

### Font Loading

```tsx
// In layout.tsx - Google Fonts via Next.js
import { Source_Sans_3 } from "next/font/google";
const sourceSans = Source_Sans_3({ subsets: ["latin"] });

// In globals.css - Custom font via @font-face
@font-face {
  font-family: 'Erstoria';
  src: url('/fonts/Erstoria.woff2') format('woff2'),
       url('/fonts/Erstoria.otf') format('opentype');
  font-weight: 400;
  font-style: normal;
  font-display: swap;
}
```

