## Spacing & Layout

### Spacing Scale (Tailwind default + custom)

Use Tailwind's default spacing scale consistently:
- `4` (1rem/16px) - Minimum comfortable spacing
- `6` (1.5rem/24px) - Default component internal spacing
- `8` (2rem/32px) - Standard gap between related elements
- `12` (3rem/48px) - Section internal padding
- `16` (4rem/64px) - Gap between sections
- `24` (6rem/96px) - Large section breaks
- `32` (8rem/128px) - Hero/major section vertical padding

