## Iconography

### Icon Library
- **Library**: Phosphor Icons (`@phosphor-icons/react`)
- **Weights**: 6 weights available (thin, light, regular, bold, fill, duotone)
- **Size scale**: 16px (inline), 20px (buttons), 24px (standalone), 32px+ (feature icons)
- **Base size**: 16px default (optimized for small-size legibility)

### Icon Weight Strategy

| Context | Weight | Example Usage |
|---------|--------|---------------|
| Navigation/sidebar | `regular` | Menu, Home, Settings icons |
| Feature cards | `duotone` | Star, TrendingUp, Shield icons |
| Empty states | `duotone` | BarChart, Send, FileText icons |
| Buttons | `regular` or `bold` | ArrowRight, Plus, Check icons |
| Status indicators | `fill` | CheckCircle, XCircle icons |
| Gamification badges | `fill` or `duotone` | Trophy, Medal, Crown icons |

### Common Icon Patterns

```jsx
import { CheckCircle, ArrowRight, Star, TrendUp } from "@phosphor-icons/react";

// Inline with text (regular weight, small size)
<span className="inline-flex items-center gap-2">
  <CheckCircle weight="regular" size={16} className="text-repwell-sage-200" />
  Feature included
</span>

// In buttons (regular weight)
<button className="inline-flex items-center gap-2">
  <ArrowRight weight="regular" size={20} />
  Continue
</button>

// Feature icon with background (duotone weight for brand emphasis)
<div className="w-12 h-12 bg-repwell-sage-100/50 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center">
  <Star weight="duotone" size={24} className="text-repwell-teal-300" />
</div>

// Large decorative icon (duotone for visual interest)
<div className="w-16 h-16 bg-gradient-to-br from-repwell-sage-100 to-repwell-sage-200/50 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center">
  <TrendUp weight="duotone" size={32} className="text-repwell-teal-400" />
</div>
```

### Duotone Brand Integration
Duotone icons support two colors for a proprietary brand feel:
```jsx
// Using duotone with brand colors
<Star
  weight="duotone"
  size={24}
  color="#52796f"  // repwell-teal-300 (primary)
/>
// Note: duotone secondary color follows the primary at 20% opacity
```

### Icon Color Rules
| Context | Icon Color |
|---------|------------|
| Default UI | `text-repwell-teal-400` |
| Interactive (links, buttons) | `text-repwell-teal-300` |
| Success/positive | `text-repwell-sage-200` |
| Muted/secondary | `text-repwell-teal-300/50` |
| On dark background | `text-white` or `text-repwell-sage-100` |
| Error/warning | Use semantic accent colors |

### Key Icon Name Changes from Lucide
When referencing icons, note these name differences:
- `ChevronDown/Up/Left/Right` → `CaretDown/Up/Left/Right`
- `Send` → `PaperPlaneRight`
- `Settings` → `Gear`
- `BarChart3` → `ChartBar`
- `TrendingUp/Down` → `TrendUp/TrendDown`
- `AlertCircle` → `WarningCircle`
- `ExternalLink` → `ArrowSquareOut`
- `RefreshCw` → `ArrowsClockwise`
- `Loader2` → `SpinnerGap`

