## Logo Usage

### Logo Files
- **Full color**: Primary usage on light backgrounds
- **Reversed**: White version for dark backgrounds
- **Monochrome**: Single color for special applications

### Clear Space
Maintain minimum clear space equal to the height of the "R" in "Rep" on all sides.

### Minimum Sizes
- **Digital**: Minimum 80px wide (full logo), 24px (icon only)
- **Print**: Minimum 1 inch wide

### Logo Placement in UI

```jsx
// Header logo
<a href="/" className="flex-shrink-0">
  <img 
    src="/repwell-logo.svg" 
    alt="Repwell" 
    className="h-8 w-auto"  // Fixed height, auto width
  />
</a>

// Footer logo (slightly smaller)
<img 
  src="/repwell-logo.svg" 
  alt="Repwell" 
  className="h-6 w-auto"
/>

// Logo on dark background
<img 
  src="/repwell-logo-white.svg" 
  alt="Repwell" 
  className="h-8 w-auto"
/>

// Favicon/icon only usage
