## Accessibility

### Color Contrast
- All text must meet WCAG AA standards (4.5:1 for normal text, 3:1 for large text)
- Primary teal (#52796f) on white: ✓ 4.9:1
- Deep teal (#2f3e46) on white: ✓ 9.3:1
- White on deep teal (#2f3e46): ✓ 9.3:1

### Focus States
Always provide visible focus indicators:
```jsx
className="focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-repwell-teal-300 focus-visible:ring-offset-2"
```

### Interactive Elements
- Minimum touch target: 44x44px
- Clear hover/active states
- Sufficient color contrast for all states

### Semantic HTML
- Use proper heading hierarchy (h1 → h2 → h3)
- Use `<button>` for actions, `<a>` for navigation
- Provide alt text for images
- Use ARIA labels where needed

### Reduced Motion
Respect user preferences:
```jsx
// In Framer Motion
<motion.div
  initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 20 }}
  animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}
  transition={{
    ...defaultTransition,
    // Disable animation if user prefers reduced motion
    ...(prefersReducedMotion && { duration: 0 }),
  }}
>
```

```css
/* In CSS */
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  * {
    animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
    animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
    transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
  }
}
```

