## Icon Registry

### Centralized Lookup (`src/lib/icons/registry.ts`)

40+ Phosphor Icons registered with smart normalization for config-driven UI:

```typescript
import { getIcon, getIconOrDefault } from "@/lib/icons/registry";

// Dynamic lookup — resolves PascalCase, kebab-case, snake_case
const Icon = getIconOrDefault("chart-bar"); // → ChartBar component
const Icon2 = getIconOrDefault("TrendUp");  // → TrendUp component

// With fallback
const Icon3 = getIconOrDefault("unknown", Star); // → Star (fallback)
```

### Key Aliases

| Config Name | Phosphor Component |
|-------------|-------------------|
| `bar-chart` | `ChartBar` |
| `trending-up` | `TrendUp` |
| `trending-down` | `TrendDown` |
| `shield-check` | `ShieldCheck` |
| `paper-plane` | `PaperPlaneRight` |
| `settings` | `Gear` |
| `external-link` | `ArrowSquareOut` |
| `refresh` | `ArrowsClockwise` |
| `loader` | `SpinnerGap` |

### Normalization Rules

Keys are normalized by: lowercase → strip hyphens, underscores, and spaces. This means `"ShieldCheck"`, `"shield-check"`, and `"shield_check"` all resolve to the same icon.

