import { fadeInUp, staggerContainer, viewportOnce, cardHover } from "@/lib/motion";
```

### Available Presets (`src/lib/motion.ts`)

#### Transitions
| Name | Description |
|------|-------------|
| `defaultTransition` | 0.3s with smooth easeOut `[0.25, 0.1, 0.25, 1]` |
| `fastTransition` | 0.15s |
| `slowTransition` | 0.5s |
| `springTransition` | Spring with stiffness 300, damping 30 |
| `bounceTransition` | Spring with stiffness 400, damping 10 |
| `morphSpring` | Smooth spring for morphing shapes |

#### Entrance Variants
| Name | Description |
|------|-------------|
| `fadeIn` | Opacity 0→1 |
| `fadeInUp` | Opacity + translateY(20→0) |
| `fadeInDown` | Opacity + translateY(-20→0) |
| `slideInLeft` | Opacity + translateX(-30→0) |
| `slideInRight` | Opacity + translateX(30→0) |
| `scaleIn` | Opacity + scale(0.95→1) |
| `zoomIn` | Opacity + scale(0.8→1) |
| `rotateIn` | Opacity + rotate(-5→0) + scale(0.95→1) |

#### Container Variants
